      "decision": "Dropped statuses_count. It is the product of the other two by construction, so it adds no information. Kept average_tweets_per_day (activity intensity) and account_age_days (account maturity), which are nearly unrelated to each other in log space."
    },
    "class_weights": {
      "0": 0.7479,
